one" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-rds-positive" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg><p class="text-muted-foreground">17 models are listed with sourced benchmark coverage in this reporting family.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="cb-container cb-container-content py-8 max-[720px]:py-7  pt-0"><div class="p-6 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card"><h2 class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-4">Score in Context</h2><div class="space-y-4"><div><h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground mb-1">What these scores mean</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">This ranking averages sourced tool-use benchmarks. It is narrower than the agentic category and focuses specifically on function calling and structured tool execution.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-3.5 w-3.5 text-rds-warning" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg> Known limitations</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Tool-use benchmarks test specific function-calling patterns. Real-world tool use also depends on prompt engineering, retry logic, and error handling that benchmarks cannot capture.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="cb-container cb-container-content py-8 max-[720px]:py-7  pt-0"><div class="p-6 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card"><h2 class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-3 text-sm">Explore More</h2><div class="[&amp;_a]:min-h-[40px] [&amp;_a]:flex [&amp;_a]:flex-col [&amp;_a]:justify-center"><nav aria-label="Related links"><ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2"><li><a class="group block rounded-lg border border-rds-hairline px-3 py-2 hover:border-rds-hairline-strong transition-colors" href="/llm-price-performance"><span class="text-sm text-foreground group-hover:text-rds-accent transition-colors">Price vs Performance Chart</span></a></li><li><a class="group block rounded-lg border border-rds-hairline px-3 py-2 hover:border-rds-hairline-strong transition-colors" href="/llm-pricing"><span class="text-sm text-foreground group-hover:text-rds-accent transition-colors">Compare Pricing</span></a></li><li><a class="group block rounded-lg border border-rds-hairline px-3 py-2 hover:border-rds-hairline-strong transition-colors" href="/tools/llm-selector"><span class="text-sm text-foreground group-hover:text-rds-accent transition-colors">Which LLM Should I Use?</span></a></li><li><a class="group block rounded-lg border border-rds-hairline px-3 py-2 hover:border-rds-hairline-strong transition-colors" href="/blog"><span class="text-sm text-foreground group-hover:text-rds-accent transition-colors">Benchmark Explainers</span></a></li></ul></nav></div></div><div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg><span>Last updated: <!-- -->August 13, 2026</span></div></section><section class="cb-container cb-container-content py-8 max-[720px]:py-7  pt-0"><aside aria-label="Radar alert option" class="border-y border-rds-hairline bg-rds-surface-panel/60 "><div class="grid min-[45.0625rem]:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] min-[45.0625rem]:items-center max-w-4xl grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-x-3 gap-y-4 px-4 py-5 sm:px-5 sm:py-6"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-rds-accent/30 bg-rds-accent/10 text-rds-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bell-ring h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 3.464 0"></path><path d="M22 8c0-2.3-.8-4.3-2-6"></path><path d="M3.262 15.326A1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326"></path><path d="M4 2C2.8 3.7 2 5.7 2 8"></path></svg></span><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-rds-accent">Radar</p><h2 class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold leading-snug text-foreground">This page is a snapshot. Radar watches the changes.</h2><p class="mt-1 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Get confirmed releases, published price changes, deprecations, and status updates by email, a signed webhook, or the Radar API.</p></div><a class="min-[45.0625rem]:col-auto min-[45.0625rem]:w-auto col-span-2 inline-flex min-h-11 w-full shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-rds-ink px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-rds-surface-panel transition-colors hover:bg-rds-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rds-accent focus:ring-offset-2" href="/radar?source=benchlm&amp;source_path=%2Fbest%2Ftool-use&amp;surface=best_page&amp;placement=content_footer&amp;entry_placement=content_footer">Start free brief<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></aside></section><section class="cb-container cb-container-content py-8 max-[720px]:py-7  pt-0"><div class="my-8 rounded-[10px] border border-rds-hairline-strong bg-rds-surface-panel p-6"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center gap-4 lg:gap-8"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail w-4 h-4 text-rds-accent" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg><h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground">Know when it’s worth switching models</h3></div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">The model to choose, the cheaper alternative, and the release we would wait on.</p><a href="/newsletter" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-xs font-semibold text-rds-accent hover:underline focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-rds-accent mt-1">Read a sample issue</a><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-rds-ink">Join 2,000+ readers.</p></div><form class="flex min-w-[18rem] flex-col gap-2 shrink-0" toolname="subscribe_to_benchlm_updates.best_detail" tooldescription="Subscribe an email address to weekly BenchLM benchmark, ranking, and pricing updates. The user must consent before submission."><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -left-[10000px] top-auto h-px w-px overflow-hidden"><label>Leave this field blank<input type="url" tabindex="-1" autoComplete="off" name="website"/></label></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row"><input type="email" toolparamtitle="Email address" toolparamdescription="The email address that should receive weekly BenchLM benchmark updates." placeholder="you@example.com" autoComplete="email" inputMode="email" aria-label="Email address" aria-invalid="false" required="" disabled="" class="min-h-11 w-full rounded-md border border-rds-hairline-strong bg-rds-surface-panel px-3 text-sm text-rds-ink placeholder:text-rds-ink-dim focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-rds-accent sm:w-56" name="email" value=""/><button type="submit" disabled="" class="min-h-11 w-full whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-rds-accent px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-rds-surface-panel transition-colors hover:bg-rds-accent/90 sm:w-auto">Loading...</button></div></form></div><p class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground mt-2">One email each week. Unsubscribe anytime.</p></div></section></main><footer data-site-footer="true" class="relative mt-10 border-t border-rds-hairline-strong bg-rds-footer before:absolute before:-top-px before:left-[max(24px,calc((100%_-_1120px)/2))] before:h-[3px] before:w-[72px] before:bg-rds-accent"><div class="mx-auto grid w-[min(1120px,calc(100%_-_48px))] grid-cols-[minmax(250px,0.82fr)_minmax(0,2fr)] gap-x-14 gap-y-10 pb-6 pt-11 max-[900px]:grid-cols-1 max-[720px]:w-[calc(100%_-_32px)] max-[720px]:pt-9"><section aria-label="About BenchLM" class="min-w-0"><a aria-label="BenchLM home" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-sm text-rds-ink focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-rds-accent" href="/"><span class="font-display text-[22px] font-bold leading-none tracking-[-0.035em]">Bench<span class="text-rds-accent">LM</span></span></a><p class="mt-2 max-w-[38ch] text-xs leading-relaxed text-rds-ink-muted">Independent LLM benchmarks, pricing, and runtime evidence. Published results expose their evidence path and review date.</p><p class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-rds-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="grid h-[18px] w-[18px] place-items-center rounded-full border border-rds-accent text-[10px]">✓</span>Supported and Estimated evidence labels</p><dl class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-5 gap-y-4"><div><dt class="text-[10px] text-rds-ink-muted">Models tracked</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-rds-ink">385</dd></div><div><dt class="text-[10px] text-rds-ink-muted">Benchmarks</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-rds-ink">414</dd></div><div class="col-span-2"><dt class="text-[10px] text-rds-ink-muted">Data refreshed</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-rds-ink">August 13, 2026</dd></div></dl><p class="mt-4 max-w-[42ch] text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-rds-ink-muted">Tracked means a model profile exists. Supported positions have sufficiently diverse direct evidence. Estimated positions remain ranked with wider uncertainty while evidence is incomplete.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-xs font-semibold text-rds-accent hover:underline focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-rds-accent" href="/methodology">How BenchLM ranks models</a></section><div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-7 max-[1040px]:grid-cols-2 max-[720px]:gap-x-8 max-[720px]:gap-y-7"><nav aria-label="Explore"><h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-rds-ink">Explore</h2><div class="mt-2 flex flex-col"><a class="inline-flex min-h-[34px] items-center rounded-sm py-1.5 text-xs leading-snug text-rds-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-rds-accent focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-rds-accent max-[720px]:min-h-11" href="/">LLM leaderboard</a><a class="inline-flex min-h-[34px] items-center rounded-sm py-1.5 text-xs leading-snug text-rds-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-rds-accent focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-rds-accent max-[720px]:min-h-11" href="/compare">Compare models</a><a class="inline-flex min-h-[34px] items-center rounded-sm py-1.5 text-xs leading-snug text-rds-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-rds-accent focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-rds-accent max-[720px]:min-h-11" href="/models">Models</a><a class="inline-flex min-h-[34px] items-center rounded-sm py-1.5 text-xs leading-snug text-rds-ink-muted transition-colors hover:text-rds-accent focus:ou